  "metaDescription": "How Kahana hub affiliate links work: drafts on Free, live links on Growth, 10–80% of creator earnings after fees, and where to read results.",
  "focusKeyword": "hub affiliate links",
  "content": "<p class=\"lead\">If someone else already has the audience, they can send buyers to a hub you price. They earn a share of what you keep. You keep the hub.</p>\n<p>This is not the signup link on <a href=\"/help/earning\">Earn</a>. Earn invites people to Kahana. A hub affiliate link points at one hub you own. Manage it at <a href=\"https://app.kahana.io/my-affiliates\">My affiliates</a>.</p>\n\n<figure style=\"margin:28px 0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#241f16;color:#f6f1e6;padding:22px;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif\">\n  <figcaption style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:14px\">My affiliates in the app</figcaption>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(224,176,90,.55);padding-bottom:8px\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span>Drafts (1)</span><span style=\"margin-left:18px;opacity:.65\">Active (0)</span></div>\n    <a href=\"https://app.kahana.io/my-affiliates\" style=\"background:#e3a23a;color:#241f16;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;white-space:nowrap\">+ Add link</a>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;border:1px solid rgba(246,241,230,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px\">\n    <div style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7b3fe4,#c45cff);flex:none\"></div>\n    <div style=\"min-width:0;flex:1\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700\">A Premium Hub</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;opacity:.75\">Draft · You · 0 views · $0.00 · 0 affiliates</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:right\">$13.00<div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:500;opacity:.7\">20% affiliate</div></div>\n    <a href=\"https://app.kahana.io/my-affiliates\" style=\"max-width:220px;border:1px solid rgba(224,176,90,.45);background:rgba(224,176,90,.12);color:#f6f1e6;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap\">Copy · kahana.io/hub/…?haff=</a>\n    <span style=\"opacity:.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚙</span>\n  </div>\n</figure>\n<h2>What you set</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A price for the hub. If you have not set one yet, the row says <strong>Price pending</strong>.</li>\n<li>An affiliate percentage from 10% to 80% of your earnings on that sale, after Kahana’s 5% and an estimate of Stripe’s card fee.</li>\n<li>Whether new affiliates need your approval, or anyone with a Kahana account can use the link.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>They need an account. They do not need to already be a member of the hub. Commission waits 14 days before it is available.</p>\n<h2>Free can draft. Growth goes live.</h2>\n<p>Choose <strong>Add link</strong>, pick the hub, and save. On Free, that save is a draft. Turn the link on for real when you are on Growth, including a trial. The editor shows what you keep and what an affiliate earns at the current price and percentage. Copy the link from the row when you are ready to hand it out.</p>\n<h2>Watch the campaign</h2>\n<p>Campaign results can show every link, one link, or a few you select. Switch today, this month, or all time, and look by earnings or by views.</p>\n\n<figure style=\"margin:28px 0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#241f16;color:#f6f1e6;padding:22px;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif\">\n  <figcaption style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:12px\">Campaign results</figcaption>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px\">\n    <span style=\"background:#e3a23a;color:#241f16;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700\">All links</span>\n    <span style=\"border:1px solid rgba(246,241,230,.25);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px\">A Premium Hub</span>\n    <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;opacity:.75\">Today · This month · <strong style=\"opacity:1\">All time</strong> · Earnings · Views</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(246,241,230,.14);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 16px 8px\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px\"><span style=\"opacity:.7\">Earnings over time</span><strong>$0.00</strong></div>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 150\" width=\"100%\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#f6f1e6\" stroke-opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n      <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#f6f1e6\" stroke-opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n      <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#f6f1e6\" stroke-opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n      <path d=\"M0 128 C 90 126, 140 116, 200 104 S 300 78, 360 64 S 480 32, 540 22 S 600 12, 640 8 L 640 145 L 0 145 Z\" fill=\"#f6f1e6\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\"/>\n      <path d=\"M0 128 C 90 126, 140 116, 200 104 S 300 78, 360 64 S 480 32, 540 22 S 600 12, 640 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f6f1e6\" stroke-opacity=\"0.55\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;opacity:.65;margin:4px 0 0\">The line fills in as your links are viewed and earn.</p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://app.kahana.io/my-affiliates\" style=\"color:#e3a23a\">Open My affiliates</a> to watch this for your own links.</p>\n</figure>\n<p>The people list under that chart shows who is on those links, whether the link is request-only or open, and what they have earned. Approve or deny a request from that list.</p>\n<p>Step-by-step: <a href=\"/help/hub-affiliate-links\">Affiliate links for your hubs</a>.</p>"
}
